------Brute force-2

TC : 0(N^2)
class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {

        int arr[] = {1, 2, 3};

        for (int start = 0; start < arr.length; start++) {

            int sum = 0;

            for (int end = start; end < arr.length; end++) {

                sum = sum + arr[end];

                System.out.println("Subarray from " + start + " to " + end
                                   + " = " + sum);
            }
        }
    }
}

===============================
Finding/generating the subarray ranges: O(n²)--sum
Printing every element of every subarray: O(n³)--all sub array printing
}   

